## 10. Edge cases

| Situation | What to do |
|---|---|
| **Member changed nothing** | Prefill and final are the same house. Set $q$ to 0; the score uses the final version only. |
| **Member confirmed values without changing MERC** | Same as above. Confirmations don't create a "member was wrong" version. |
| **Prefill MERC or range unavailable** | Skip the "member was wrong" version, and cap the tier at 🟡 Medium with the reason "no prefill MERC to compare." |
| **PCS missing** | Use the PCS 1 value (the most cautious), and say so in the reason. |
| **Final range missing** | Use the prefill range's spread, cap the tier at 🟡 Medium, and say so in the reason. If both ranges are missing, 🔴 Low with the reason "no Verisk range." |
| **Square-footage change crosses a size band** | Each version uses the neighborhood reference for its own size band. |
| **Range not centered on the MERC** | Only the range's *width* is used; the center is always the MERC itself. |

